aristotle-politics-4.logic.r1: argue/scope: P2 (S3): read with the necessity on its consequent alone, only_parts ∧ parts_differ → □combos_species, the argument holds; read with it on the whole conditional, □(only_parts ∧ parts_differ → combos_species), C (S3) does not follow: it needs the necessity of the consequent, not only of the consequence, and which the sentence means decides the argument
